sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant F as AIBO-FRONTEND (React 19)
  participant B as AIBO-BACKEND (Express 5)
  participant M as MongoDB (rs0)
  participant R as Redis 7
  participant E as AIBO-ENGINE-V1.0 (FastAPI)
  participant G as LLM Gateway (Gemini/OpenAI/Ollama)

  F->>B: POST /api/v1/ai/chat with X-Request-Id & JWT
  B->>B: Verify Auth, Rate-Limit & Hydrate Project Context
  B->>R: Check Session & Token Cache
  B->>M: Fetch Recent Conversation History
  B->>E: POST /orchestrate (monotonic deadline + X-Engine-Secret)
  E->>E: NLU Intent Classification & Temporal Entity Resolution
  E->>G: Invoke Model Provider (Fallback circuits active)
  G-->>E: Provider Tokens & Raw Generation
  E->>E: LangGraph Plan & Action Proposal Generation
  E-->>B: Standard Orchestration Result Envelope
  alt High-Risk Action (Delete / Reassign / Bulk Update)
    B->>B: Generate Cryptographic HMAC Confirmation Token
    B-->>F: ActionPendingConfirmation + Token
    F-->>B: POST /api/v1/ai/confirm with HMAC Token
    B->>M: Atomic Token Claim & MongoDB Multi-Doc Transaction
    B-->>F: ActionExecuted Confirmation
  else Safe Read or Low-Risk Mutate
    B->>M: Execute Direct MongoDB Mutation
    B-->>F: HTTP 200 OK Action Executed
  end
